     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ganhe REP com graffiti e desafie a FRANKS para descobrir informações sobre o DJ Cyber.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>REP is an ingame mechanic reflected in the UI and dialogue. Stands for reputation. Preferably untranslated</text:p>
